# modules/print/env.schema — KEY=description:required|optional
SENTINEL_DOMAIN=Firm domain; print.<domain> is the mesh-only gateway hostname:required
SENTINEL_DATA_DIR=Host data root; supplies the read-only /certs wildcard mount:required
MESH_BIND_IP=Mesh interface IP — 631/9100/8632 and the scanner listeners bind here ONLY:required
POSTGRES_USER=Shared Postgres user; Vibe Print uses the separate vibe_print database:required
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=Shared Postgres password:required
PRINT_SPOOL_HOLD_HOURS=Hours a held job waits for release before secure delete (default 4):required
ONSITE_SUBNETS=Comma-separated firm on-premises CIDRs. A job from these releases immediately with NO PIN; anything else is held (Decision 26):required
TZ=Firm timezone; print audit timestamps and hold expiry render in it:optional
PRINTER_SUBNETS=Printer VLAN or NetBird-routed printer CIDRs; consumed by printer-network-policy.sh:optional
PRINTER_IFACE=Host interface facing the printer VLAN, when printers are not NetBird-routed:optional
